- `internal/config/config.go` - YAML config parsing + validation
- `internal/deployer/deployer.go` - Deploy orchestration (478 lines, 8-step process)
- `internal/webhook/server.go` - GitHub webhook HTTP handler
- `internal/secrets/store.go` - Age-encrypted secrets management
- `cmd/` - CLI commands following Cobra pattern

